","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["guanzhang-e-p024e-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"guanzhang-e-p024e-q","source_order":[36,198,"P024e"],"order":6934},{"id":"pangfa-e-o022b","title":"刘备入孙夫人处畏武装侍婢","accounts":[{"id":"pangfa-e-o022b-account","label":"《庞统法正传第七》正文","text":"孙权妹侍婢执刀侍立，刘备每入心怀凛惧。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o022b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"畏惧","evidence":["pangfa-e-o022b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0043","role":"侍婢持刀","evidence":["pangfa-e-o022b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"刘备与孙氏婚后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["pangfa-e-o022b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"pangfa-e-o022b-q","source_order":[37,148,"O022b"],"order":6996}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0043","name":"孙氏（刘备妻）","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o031","guanzhang-q-p024","pangfa-q-o021","erfei-q-6c41f9ea48b389b8eb64","erfei-q-01c512ca08c4b92b8671","erfei-q-86fe3baeedeb76d1f991"],"facts":[{"id":"xianzhu-f0028","label":"婚姻","text":"孙权之妹，刘备妻","evidence":["xianzhu-f0028-q"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o031-xianzhu-p0043","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o031","xianzhu-q-b-c6b28cbeb0b4dea4d007"]},{"id":"guanzhang-m-p024-xianzhu-p0043","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["guanzhang-q-p024"]},{"id":"pangfa-m-o021-xianzhu-p0043","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-o021"]},{"id":"pangfa-m-o022-xianzhu-p0043","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["pangfa-q-o022"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"erfei-q-01c512ca08c4b92b8671","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-46243ff94b4566a8a9e1","layer":"pei","quote":"吴遣迎孙夫人","attribution":"裴注·汉晋春秋","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e26d52ed69bc9da71903","start":18,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q-6c41f9ea48b389b8eb64","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-e1720e70babf6930eb0b","layer":"original","quote":"而孙夫人还吴","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":33,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":7,"end":13,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"erfei-q-86fe3baeedeb76d1f991","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-46243ff94b4566a8a9e1","layer":"pei","quote":"夫人欲将太子归吴","attribution":"裴注·汉晋春秋","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":46,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-e26d52ed69bc9da71903","start":25,"end":33,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-e-p024e-q","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-41949c93fbffbb7cc1da","layer":"pei","quote":"权闻备西征，大遣舟船，迎妹；而夫人内欲将后主还吴，云与张飞勒兵截江，乃得后主还。","attribution":"《云别传》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-26a4b4aa30fcb9c70f24","start":276,"end":316,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"guanzhang-q-p024","section":"chapter-036","block":"b-41949c93fbffbb7cc1da","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《云别传》曰：“初，先主之败，有人言‘云已北去’者，先主以手戟擿之曰：‘子龙不弃我走也！’顷之，云至。从平江南，以为偏将军，领桂阳太守，代赵范。范寡嫂曰樊氏，有国色，范欲以配云。云辞曰：‘相与同姓，卿兄犹我兄！’固辞不许。时有人劝云纳之，云曰：‘范迫降耳，心未可测；天下女不少！’遂不取。范果逃走，云无纤介。先是，与夏侯惇战于博望，生获夏侯兰。兰是云乡里人，少小相知；云白先主，活之，荐兰明于法律，以为军正，云不用自近。其慎虑类如此。先主入益州，云领留营司马。此时先主孙夫人，以权妹骄豪，多将吴吏兵，纵横不法。先主以云严重，必能整齐，特任掌内事。权闻备西征，大遣舟船，迎妹；而夫人内欲将后主还吴，云与张飞勒兵截江，乃得后主还。”","attribution":"《云别传》","section_title":"关张马黄赵传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0078.xhtml","index":197,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-26a4b4aa30fcb9c70f24","start":0,"end":317,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-o022a-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-cd8160c32dda91c8b93d","layer":"original","quote":"初，孙权以妹妻先主。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-e-o022b-q","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-cd8160c32dda91c8b93d","layer":"original","quote":"妹才捷刚猛，有诸兄之风；侍婢百余人，皆亲执刀侍立；先主每入，衷心常凛凛〖18〗。","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":10,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-o021","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-f386822659cca9c963b7","layer":"original","quote":"以正为蜀郡太守，扬武将军，外统都畿〖8〗，内为谋主。一餐之德，睚眦之怨〖9〗，无不报复；擅杀毁伤己者数人〖10〗。或谓诸葛亮曰〖11〗：“法正于蜀郡太纵横〖12〗；将军宜启主公，抑其威福〖13〗。”亮答曰：“主公之在公安也，北畏曹公之强，东惮孙权之逼，近则惧孙夫人生变于肘腋之下〖14〗：当斯之时，进退狼跋〖15〗。法孝直为之辅翼，令翻然翱翔〖16〗，不可复制。如何禁止法正〖17〗，使不得行其意邪！”","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":201,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"pangfa-q-o022","section":"chapter-037","block":"b-cd8160c32dda91c8b93d","layer":"original","quote":"初，孙权以妹妻先主。妹才捷刚猛，有诸兄之风；侍婢百余人，皆亲执刀侍立；先主每入，衷心常凛凛〖18〗。亮又知先主雅爱信正〖19〗，故言如此。﹝二﹞","section_title":"庞统法正传第七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0080.xhtml","index":147,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o031b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-a5287409ad1bb0d56cad","layer":"original","quote":"权稍畏之，进妹固好〖4〗；","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-f0028-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-a5287409ad1bb0d56cad","layer":"original","quote":"权稍畏之，进妹固好〖4〗；","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":18,"end":31,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-c6b28cbeb0b4dea4d007","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-c6b28cbeb0b4dea4d007","layer":"modern","quote":"〖4〗妹：即刘备妻子孙氏。事见本书卷三十七《法正传》、卷三十四《先主吴穆皇后传》裴注引《汉晋春秋》。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":146,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-af91b74d652d66b0a933","start":0,"end":50,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o031","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-a5287409ad1bb0d56cad","layer":"original","quote":"琦病死，群下推先主为荆州牧，治公安。权稍畏之，进妹固好〖4〗；先主至京见权〖5〗，绸缪恩纪〖6〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":137,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
